  "description": "MEHFIS crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C34 H80 F9 La4 N18 O18 3+,3(C2 F3 O2 1-),7(H2 O1),C2 H1 F3 O2. From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 6 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 6 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 6 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.013-4.116 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.61-111.56°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C42H95N18O33F21La4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 7 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
